<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA CONFIRMS SAULES MERGER PLANS.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA CONFIRMS SAULES MERGER PLANS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank on Thursday confirmed to the stock exchange that it foresees a possible merger with Latvia's Saules Banka.</p>
<p>&quot;Tallinna Pank sees in its short-term strategy a possible merger with Saules Banka,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Tallinna deputy chairman Targo Raus had earlier told a news conference that it had agreed in principle to take over 100 percent of Saules Bank. It currently has 20 percent.  </p>
<p>Tallinna Pank added that the bank has not agreed on the conditions and technicalities of a possible merger, adding that the bank plans to finish the talks this year.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
